---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never inherit style from other css files
- Always make custom css style for each file
- Features in the specific jsx file should only use the styles in the corresponding css file
- With every single named element make the name file specific by prepending the file name before the actual name to avoid inheritance
- If you see any css style being inherited please remove the inheritance by changing the name to a file specific name, if the css style is lost restore it by rebuilding the style from scratch